---
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute -left-24 top-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-ember-200/50 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-0 top-24 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-ink-200/60 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-40 bg-gradient-to-t from-cream to-transparent"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-page relative grid items-center gap-12 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] md:py-24">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <p class="section-label">AI automation agency</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-ink-950 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Cut the busywork. Keep the human touch.
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
        PookaAI helps local and SMB service businesses put AI to work on real
        operations — intake, follow-up, scheduling noise, and the glue between
        your tools — starting with a clear audit, not a science project.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="/start">
          Request an AI audit
        </a>
        <a class="btn-secondary" href="#services">See what we build</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-500">
        Built for owners who sell services — not pitch decks.
        Prefer email?
        <a class="font-medium text-ink-700 underline decoration-ember-300 underline-offset-2 hover:text-ink-950" href="mailto:hello@pookaai.com">hello@pookaai.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div class="rounded-4xl border border-ink-900/10 bg-white/80 p-6 shadow-soft backdrop-blur">
        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">A week with Pooka</p>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-mist px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-ink-700">practical</span>
        </div>
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="rounded-3xl bg-cream p-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">1. Map the mess</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-600">Where time leaks, where leads stall, what tools already exist.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="rounded-3xl bg-ink-900 p-4 text-cream">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold">2. Pick the win</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-200">One high-leverage automation or bot — scoped, priced, shippable.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="rounded-3xl bg-ember-50 p-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">3. Hand it over clean</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-600">Working system, plain docs, and a path to expand later.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-3 rotate-3 rounded-2xl bg-ember-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-950 shadow-card">
        No fake dashboards.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
